IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SIMPLE-INTEREST.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PRINCIPAL-AMT PIC 9(6).
01 WS-YEAR PIC 9(2).
01 WS-INTEREST PIC 9(2).
01 WS-SIMPLE-INTEREST-AMT PIC 9(6).
01 WS-TOTAL-AMT PIC 9(6).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
DISPLAY "ENTER THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT :".
ACCEPT WS-PRINCIPAL-AMT.

DISPLAY "ENTER THE NUMBER OF YEARS :".
ACCEPT WS-YEAR.

DISPLAY "ENTER THE RATE OF INTEREST :".
ACCEPT WS-INTEREST.

COMPUTE WS-SIMPLE-INTEREST-AMT = (WS-PRINCIPAL-AMT * WS-YEAR * WS-INTEREST)/100.
DISPLAY "WS-SIMPLE-INTEREST-AMT : " WS-SIMPLE-INTEREST-AMT.
COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-AMT = WS-PRINCIPAL-AMT + WS-SIMPLE-INTEREST-AMT.
DISPLAY "------------------------------------".
DISPLAY "TOTAL AMOUNT :" WS-TOTAL-AMT.
DISPLAY "------------------------------------".
STOP-RUN.
